{"script":"wt_c2_08_1_y","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“车夫”德利特尔","text":"[show]好好好！就是这个东西，太感谢了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“车夫”德利特尔","text":"[show]医生说只要我坚持吃大力丸，我的力量会慢慢提升，最后变得像正常矿工一样。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“车夫”德利特尔","text":"[show]不过……我也考虑过是否这样就足够了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“车夫”德利特尔","text":"[show]光吃大力丸不锻炼，再好的身体也会衰弱下去吧……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“车夫”德利特尔","text":"[show]不过按我每天的工作量来说，这也不是什么问题。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“车夫”德利特尔","text":"[show]只希望有效果吧！最重要的还是坚持！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"重金求得的药方"}